@startuml
title miner clone --organization <org>
actor Usuario
participant "CLI" as CLI
participant "clone.pipeline" as Pipeline
participant "clone.github_api" as API
participant "Git" as Git
database "Disco local" as Disk

Usuario -> CLI: clone -o pallets
CLI -> CLI: Cargar .env y validar GITHUB_TOKEN
CLI -> Pipeline: clone_organization(org, token, workspace, timeout)
Pipeline -> API: Listar y validar todos los repositorios
API --> Pipeline: Repositorios
note right of API: Un error global termina el comando.
Pipeline -> Disk: Crear work/clone-<id>/
loop Repositorios ordenados por nombre
    Pipeline -> Git: clone --depth 1
    alt Clonacion correcta
        Git -> Disk: repositories/<org>/<repo>/
        Pipeline -> Pipeline: Registrar ruta local
    else Fallo de clonacion
        Pipeline -> Pipeline: Registrar error y continuar
    end
    Pipeline --> CLI: Progreso para stderr
end
Pipeline -> Disk: Guardar clones.json (tambien si esta vacio)
Pipeline --> CLI: OrganizationCloneResult
CLI --> Usuario: JSON con rutas, errores y conteos en stdout
@enduml
